      "creatureType": "humanoid",
      "blurb": "Beguiler: Beguiling Duplicity",
      "biography": "<p><em>Beguiling Duplicity (Beguiler, 2nd level).</em> A perfect visual illusion of yourself, summoned as a Bonus Action into an unoccupied space you can see within 15 feet. It lasts 1 minute, or until you dismiss it on your turn (no action) or are incapacitated. Up to 3 at once; you command one at a time. It's intangible, doesn't occupy its space, and is a Genjutsu you cast of the highest rank you can cast.</p><p><strong>Armor Class</strong> your Genjutsu save DC · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 1 (at 0 it's dispelled) · <strong>Speed</strong> your speed (no flying unless you can fly).</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> it looks like you (your token's name, image and size), and its level, AC, speed and fly speed are set from yours.</p>",
      "summonRole": "Duplicity"
    },
