      "name": "Illusory Body",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>While the Duplicity doesn't occupy space it can be attacked. It has an AC equal to your Genjutsu Save DC and 1 hit point. If its hit points are reduced to 0, it is dispelled. Creatures cannot discern which of you are real unless they take the Identify Genjutsu skill-Action. A creature with Chakra Sight, Chakra Sensing, True Sight or Tremor Sense can always tell which of you are real, becoming immune to Illusory Distraction.</p>",
